            "src/main/java/org/opentripplanner/routing/api/request/RouteRequestLocationProximity.java"
          ],
          "details": "Remove Coordinate, Envelope, and SphericalDistanceLibrary imports from RouteRequest after extraction. Add only the same-package helper reference required by RouteRequest, and add Coordinate, Envelope, and SphericalDistanceLibrary imports to RouteRequestLocationProximity. No public signatures or call sites change.",
